        "h3": {
          "en": "Install the tube holder",
          "zh": "安装导管支架"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Install it on the top extrusion, beside the control board. Its 4 mm hole holds the fixed end of the Teflon tube.",
          "zh": "装在顶部型材上，紧邻控制板。特氟龙管的固定端插入支架的 4 mm 孔。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
